# Example xcalendar events file (libcalrepeat .calendar format).
#
# Copy this to the path xcalendar reads from (default
# ~/.config/xcalendar/events.calendar, or $XCALENDAR_CALENDAR).
#
# This is meant for birthdays, anniversaries and other important dates, not for
# everyday reminders.
#
# One event per line: an optional name followed by " - " and a recurrence rule,
# or just a rule. Lines that are blank or start with '#' are ignored.

Aurora's Birthday - every 15th of june
New Year - every 1th of january
